sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Background application
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant Gateway as Gateway + policy
    participant Runtime as Application Runtime
    participant Identity as AgentCore Identity
    participant Graph as Graph / SharePoint
    Note over App,Graph: Target design - app-only ingress disabled pending validation
    App->>Entra: Client credentials - request Gateway access
    Entra-->>App: Token A - application token for Gateway
    App->>Gateway: Operation and site with Token A
    Note over Gateway: Validate application and authorize role
    Note over Gateway,Runtime: Lambda relays the original signed caller context
    Gateway->>Runtime: Gateway AWS identity + signed caller context
    Note over Runtime: Verify caller and allowed site + operation
    Note over Runtime: Select approved downstream application
    Runtime->>Identity: Request Graph token for approved provider
    Identity->>Entra: Client credentials for downstream Graph application
    Entra-->>Identity: Token G - application token for Microsoft Graph
    Identity-->>Runtime: Token G
    Runtime->>Graph: Execute operation with Token G
    Note over Graph: Enforce application's selected-site grants
    Graph-->>Runtime: Result or denial
    Runtime-->>Gateway: Bounded response
    Gateway-->>App: Result or failure
